## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | test/hub/local_hub_relay_concurrency_test.dart | 🚨 blocking scope violation — 128 unintended files 54 2k lines committed with the fix this pr s described scope is two changes in one file test hub local hub relay concurrency test dart and the description itself states no product code change the actual diff contains 129 files 1 test fix 128 added cursor skills dmtools files 54 189 lines — the local dmtools skill installation of the authoring environment vendor docs from epam dm ai setup dmtools sh installed skills json a 10 597 line raw mcp tools raw json dump evidence from git diff name status origin main head 128 × a cursor skills dmtools — none of them referenced anywhere in the repo cursor is untracked on origin main git ls tree origin main cursor is empty the whole dump landed in the single fix commit 2032b9e714 — consistent with a git add that swept local agent tooling state into the commit this contradicts the repo s documented hygiene policy local tooling state stays out of git gitignore 88 104 keeps local only junk untracked behind an explicit whitelist agents md 782 — logs sessions bash jobs stay local the repo s curated skills live under the whitelisted fah skills not cursor skills security note checked and clean i scanned all 128 files for secrets — pat token patterns high entropy strings machine specific paths org names everything found is vendor placeholder text your ado personal access token ghp yourpersonalaccesstokenhere redacted high entropy string markers shipped by the vendor docs themselves no real credentials are committed — the problem is scope repo hygiene not leakage next steps 1 strip everything except test hub local hub relay concurrency test dart from this branch e g git rm r cached cursor git commit amend or rebase the single commit branch onto main with only the test file staged 2 optionally add cursor to gitignore so this class of local state can never be staged again 3 re push — the test fix itself is solid verified below nothing else needs to change |
